      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An elderly lady suffering from Paget's disease presented with severe back pain after sustaining a fall. The rise in inflammatory markers and poor response to analgesics led to the diagnosis of septic discitis [corrected] that was confirmed by MRI. A high index of suspicion for septic discitis [corrected] is necessary in elderly patients presenting with back pain and an associated rise in inflammatory markers."},
